{"schemaVersion":"public-read-v0.1","items":[{"publicId":"public-rss-ac77c43c8404354c9c2b567497bde568c1f5ecaf28c9d417f44c74fcc23f363e","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"梅赛德斯称“资金不足”难与对手升级竞争","summaryZh":"梅赛德斯F1车队领队托托·沃尔夫表示，车队“没有足够的资金”像迈凯伦和法拉利那样大力研发2026年赛车。迈凯伦和法拉利近期通过大量升级取得了显著进步，双双成为多场比赛的冠军。而梅赛德斯则采取了较为保守的升级策略，导致其竞争力相对落后。","publishedAt":"2026-08-27T05:15:01.502Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-08-24T12:40:31.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"autosport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Autosport","byline":"Autosport","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-4.motorsport.com/images/amp/0Zq8R7R6/s6/andrea-kimi-antonelli-mercedes-2.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":365885,"altZh":"梅赛德斯称“资金不足”难与对手升级竞争"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.autosport.com/f1/news/mercedes-hasnt-got-the-money-to-keep-up-with-rival-teams-f1-upgrades/10848986/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=uk","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-0ff636a1cb6490e35544cb51ed262f7aabe51f68b35a54422f3b762a1a6c5f70","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"法拉利解释汉密尔顿荷兰大奖赛无线电爆发：并非实验品","summaryZh":"法拉利车队负责人弗雷德·瓦塞尔澄清了刘易斯·汉密尔顿在荷兰大奖赛期间无线电爆发的原因。法拉利连续第二场比赛未能登上领奖台，汉密尔顿获得第四，队友夏尔·勒克莱尔第五。瓦塞尔解释了车队在比赛中的策略意图，并回应了汉密尔顿感觉自己像“实验品”的言论。","publishedAt":"2026-08-27T05:15:01.502Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-08-24T11:30:04.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"autosport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Autosport","byline":"Autosport","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-4.motorsport.com/images/amp/0qgKX8OY/s6/charles-leclerc-ferrari-lewis--2.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":122578,"altZh":"法拉利解释汉密尔顿荷兰大奖赛无线电爆发：并非实验品"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.autosport.com/f1/news/what-ferrari-actually-meant-to-do-when-hamilton-felt-like-a-guinea-pig-in-dutch-gp/10848